      Add append-only provenance store (TODO 05)
    
      ProvenanceRecord model mirrors PROVENANCE_SPEC v0.1 exactly; nested
      spec objects stored as JSONField, correction_of/disputes as
      self-referential FKs enforcing referential integrity. Canonicalization
      lives in betat_community/common/hashing.py (shared with federation/
      workflow per the API-structure decision), not store/ — moved there
      from an initial store/canonical.py placement.
    
      append() is the sole write path: validates hi_tag, required fields,
      and the content.type == community.content_type rule; always
      recomputes record_id server-side. Three independent append-only
      layers: no update()/delete() in store.py, AppendOnlyQuerySet +
      Model.delete() raise NotSupportedError at the ORM level, and SQLite
      guard triggers (0002_guard_triggers migration) block raw UPDATE/DELETE
      at the DB level.
    
